Axes -- An option to draw axes
******************************

Description
===========

Axes can take the values False (no axes are drawn), True (standard axes), or
Frame (a box with value ticks). Only has an effect if in the outermost *note
VectorGraphics: Top, object.

+-----------------------------------------------+
|i1 : Circle{Radius=>25,Axes=>true}             |
|                                               |
|o1 = Circle{Axes => true                      }|
|            cache => CacheTable{}              |
|            Center => GraphicsCoordinate | 0 | |
|                                         | 0 | |
|                                         | 0 | |
|                                         | 1 | |
|            Radius => 25                       |
|            style => MutableHashTable{}        |
|                                               |
|o1 : Circle                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------+
