Blur -- An option to blur a VectorGraphics object
*************************************************

Description
===========

This corresponds to the feGaussianBlur SVG filter. The value is the amount of
blurriness relative to the size of the object.

Caveat
======

In animated 3d, the amount of blurriness does not vary as the size varies.

