listPlot -- Graphical representation of a list
**********************************************

Description
===========

Given a list of real numbers or vectors, this function joins them together to
form a piecewise linear curve. If the arguments are numbers, they form the y
coordinates, and the x coordinates are assumed to be regularly spaced.

The optional argument Join specifies whether points should be connected by a
line.

