Margin -- An option to specify the margin
*****************************************

Description
===========

The margin is proportional to the size of the image. It increases the view port
beyond the value returned by *note viewPort: viewPort, or set by *note
ViewPort: ViewPort,. Only has an effect if in the outermost *note
VectorGraphics: Top, object.

