OneSided
********

Description
===========

A property of *note GraphicsPoly: GraphicsPoly, 3d objects, means that polygons
must be drawn only if they are facing the correct way.

For the programmer
==================

The object *note OneSided: OneSided, is a *note symbol: (Macaulay2Doc)Symbol,.

