rotation -- Computes a rotation matrix
**************************************

  * Usage: 
        rotation ( angle, axis, center)
        rotation ( angle, center)

Description
===========

Produces a rotation encoded as a 4x4 matrix that can be used as an argument to
*note TransformMatrix: TransformMatrix, or *note AnimMatrix: AnimMatrix,. For a
3d rotation, use 3d vectors for axis and center. For a 2d rotation, use a 2d
vector for the center. In both cases, the center is optional.

