Size -- Set the size of a picture
*********************************

Description
===========

An option to fix the size of the *note GraphicsObject: GraphicsObject, in HTML
em units (1em = font size = width of one line of text). Only has an effect if
in the outermost *note GraphicsObject: GraphicsObject,. Can be either a vector
{ width, height } or a number (diagonal).

