viewPort -- ViewPort of view port
*********************************

Description
===========

viewPort gives the range of view port occupied by a *note GraphicsObject:
GraphicsObject,, as computed by the package.

Caveat
======

viewPort does not take into account the width of "stroke"s.

See also
========

  * *note ViewPort: ViewPort, -- Fix the view port

